WEBVTT

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.080
You really Level 3?

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.460
What kind of legs are those?

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.280
What that mage said was true.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.660
In exchange for casting my curse, 
my Status takes a sudden drop.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:32.890
Right now, my body's so heavy, 
I can't do anything with it.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:33.770
Still...

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.090
I'm coming for you.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.040
Take this!

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.320
Careful, now.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.540
This spear has a curse on it, too.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:00.710
Whether you use potions or magic,
 that cut won't close.

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:06.610
Don't die too quickly. Entertain me.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.940
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:41.090
Dix Perdix
The Dreams of Beasts

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.300
Ilta, what of the other monsters?

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.090
We've captured most of them.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.720
All that's left is that one.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:49.700
Very good.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.400
They've caused us quite a 
bit of difficulty, but...

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.360
we've finally reached the end.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.780
After we've captured this one, we'll go 
after the group that ran east of the woods.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.850
And we'll bring in the group that 
went to the town with Medaka.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.950
His name is Madaka, Sis.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.070
Both of those are wrong.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.050
Sis?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.180
Hey, Little Rookie.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:29.840
Do you know why Daedalus' bloodline has 
abided by our ancestor's insane last will?

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.190
Because our blood makes us.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.560
Daedalus' blood rages at us.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:39.540
It tells us to finish this labyrinth!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.060
It throbs, aching...

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.660
behind our eyes, inside our heads! 
Knossos itself and the plans for it...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.120
they drag at us, melting us into sludge!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.860
No one can escape this blood binding!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.790
Blood... binding...

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.170
I loathe this labyrinth.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.180
I wish it would just disappear.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.450
The only one allowed to 
give me orders is me!

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.740
Right?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.230
But I can't destroy it.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.820
Far from it...

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:17.780
Daedalus' blood keeps ordering 
me to complete his opus.

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.700
It's infuriating!

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.880
Even diving into the Dungeon,

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.500
and killing every monster I could 
find couldn't satiate me.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.700
That's when I found them...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.210
Those talking monsters!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:38.700
He went and changed, that Dix.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:39.890
Changed?

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.240
Yeah.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:45.310
While he was hurting those 
monsters to make them obey.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:49.970
He saw them crying and screaming, 
and his eyes started to get this sparkle...

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:57.390
They're not like regular monsters. 
They cry and beg for their lives!

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:01.280
These monsters born from the 
Dungeon that drove Daedalus mad...

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.820
I can't get enough!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.560
That's when I understood.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.320
I humiliated those monsters,

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.990
made them cry, plunged them into despair,
 treated them like trash...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:16.540
And for the first time, I felt whole!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.750
I could quiet the hunger in my blood!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:23.840
And in a flash, his method and 
objective switched places.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.710
It was adorable, you know?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.370
His face when his realization 
began to lead to his salvation...

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:33.190
It's a wonderful feeling!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:37.460
Beating your blood means 
overcoming yourself!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:41.530
No alcohol or drugs could sate me. 
This is the greatest ecstasy!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.390
What I seek now is simple.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.810
What you did to the Xenos... to Wiene...

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.550
It was for something that stupid?

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.200
"Something that stupid"...

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.110
Take that back, kid.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:04.090
You don't know what it's like, do you? 
This urge in the blood that can't be denied...

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.210
This scorching feeling in the back of your 
eyes that you can't do anything about...

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.990
This curse!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:16.460
That guy, that Dix, he's not thinking 
about Knossos at all anymore.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:21.640
Right now, he is that thing I love 
so much... a beast's dream.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:13.530
I've been... allowed to live...

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:19.260
They talk, but that's all. It doesn't 
change the fact they're monsters.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:22.900
Killing them brutally, gruesomely... 
What's wrong with that?

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.210
That's how you've made it this far, right?

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.510
But... even given that's true...

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.630
Lyd-san and the others...

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.500
They can laugh.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.320
They can cry, just like we do!

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.100
They can even take our hands—

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.820
You must have gone mad, too.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:47.950
I'll bring you back to your senses.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.660
Follow me!

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:02.540
Where are we going?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.250
You had the hots for that vouivre, right?

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:09.050
W-Wait!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:21.780
Wiene!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.350
Bell!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.410
Bell!

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:35.860
Little Rookie, I've got a question for you.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:40.550
If I rip this off this thing, 
what do you think will happen?

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.320
N-No...

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.460
Stop, please...

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:49.680
Who I am will disappear...

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.590
Bye then, monster.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:21.250
So this is what happens!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.200
Wiene...

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:37.800
Wh-What is that?

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.550
It can't be...

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.880
Is that Wiene?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.000
They can laugh?

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.930
They can cry?

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:56.100
Looking at this, can you still say the same 
things you did earlier, Little Rookie?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.360
Now you understand, right?

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.740
They're just monsters!

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:09.410
The enemy of humanity! Monsters!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.960
You've nearly been killed by them, right?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.060
By vouivres and lizardmen!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:21.090
Open your eyes! Hurry up 
and come to this side!

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.840
That's it, Bell Cranel!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:57.910
Kill the monsters! Kill them! Kill them all!

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.880
Bell!

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.600
It's all right.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.180
Everything... is all right.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.640
Everything is all right.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:26.220
Good.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.450
Bell!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.030
Wiene...

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.290
I'm right here.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:38.250
Be...ll...

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:39.910
Wiene...

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:46.310
Be...ll...

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:03.370
Wiene!

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.630
Well, that's no fun.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.930
What d'you think you're doing?

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.780
You're a complete disappointment!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:17.350
That knife was made to slit 
that thing's belly, wasn't it?

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:20.470
What're you doing letting 
monsters make you crazy? Huh?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.710
Saving monsters? Where's the value, 
the honor, the duty in that?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.970
When you're saving someone...

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.980
whether it's a person or a 
monster makes no difference!

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:39.070
If they're asking for help...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.690
That's more than enough!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:43.850
Bell Cranel... you are...

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:47.360
You're a hypocrite!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.810
You're going to save people and monsters?

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.130
That's impossible!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.500
You're not a rabbit...

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.160
You're not at a rabbit at all!
You're a filthy bat!

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.680
This is so boring.

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:05.210
Basically, you're just some 
kid lacking in brains.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.150
We're done. Just die.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:12.680
You?!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.130
Lyd-san!

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:16.590
To think that the words of a human...

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:20.150
could fire me up this much...

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.410
Blast it, I'm so happy!

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:26.620
So happy that I could just blow aside 
some incomprehensible power!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.560
Wh-Wha—

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.290
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:35.410
What're you coming to your 
senses for, monster?

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.760
This is bad. Dix!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.670
You will not interfere!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.590
That dirty little...

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.300
You lot, kill that mage!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.050
You guys...

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:16.220
What are you holding back for?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:35.630
What are we...

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.150
Gros! Has the curse been broken?

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:41.610
We did it, Bell-cchi!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.800
No. The feel of that punch just now...

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.740
Ow...

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.210
That hurt!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.000
It can't be...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.370
He released the curse of his own accord, 
and survived by returning to his true Status?

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.570
I won't let him do as he likes anymore!

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:05.600
H-Hey, lay off! If you do that...

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.500
I'll break this.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.430
That's Wiene's!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.690
So this is important after all!

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:15.900
If you want it, I'll give it to you!

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.690
It's all going so perfectly to plan,
I can't help laughing!

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.100
Lose your way in an unending illusion.

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:44.700
Bell! Bell!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.930
...ll! Bell!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:50.760
And the finishing touch...

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.680
Go!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:01.630
Bell!

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.640
Wiene!

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.140
Beyond this point is a straight 
shot to the surface.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.190
If something like that appears,

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.530
there's no doubt it'll be dealt with, right?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.450
Dix Perdix!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.230
Quit worrying about me.

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.170
Hurry up and go after that thing!

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.750
Damn it!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.570
Lyd-san! I'm going!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.740
Lyd! I leave the rest to you!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.910
Wait, Bell Cranel! I will heal your wounds!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.980
Bell-cchi...

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.510
Lyd! Gros!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.980
What is all this?

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:46.450
Rei, you're safe!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.910
I see. Then he...

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:54.120
Yes. He saved us, then headed off.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:57.210
I don't think there were any 
lives lost among the humans.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.390
On our side... we let the 
head of our enemies escape.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.630
He's dangerous! We cannot 
leave him as he is!

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:07.330
But... with the way things look...

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.930
Some of our friends cannot move.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:15.090
To chase after someone in their 
own territory is too reckless.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.790
I'm of the same opinion.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.380
Right now, we should go help Bell-cchi!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:24.260
If we go to the surface, it may 
make things even more complicated.

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:29.100
Even so, this time it's our turn 
to save Bell-cchi and Wiene!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:35.370
Fels is one thing, but I can't 
leave this to that boy!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.330
I will go, too!

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:38.780
Those who can fight, follow me!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.620
Yeah!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.340
Hey, Gros.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:51.920
There really are those among the 
humans we can trust, right?

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:55.380
Not yet! I can't go so far as trust yet!

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.340
You just can't be straightforward, can you?

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:00.320
Dia Panakeia.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.900
This is...

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.860
Just like an elixir, it is what 
might be called all-healing magic.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.720
Thank you very much, Fels-san!

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:24.740
Seriously?

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:28.950
Help me...

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.580
Dix... Where are you?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.850
Damn it... Those monsters!

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:38.380
I will never forgive them!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:45.150
If we came to Daedalus Street, I thought 
we'd figure something out, but...

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:47.540
The layout is just too complicated.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.350
Yes, even more than we'd expected.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:54.320
We can hardly search for the 
enemy's stronghold like this.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.210
Help!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:04.260
What...

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.450
A monster!

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:14.840
Mikoto-chan, wait! That's...

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:16.910
It can't be...

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.060
It's... Wiene-sama!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.800
Wiene-sama... why?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.980
Bell-sama!

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:33.830
Bell-kun!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:34.430
Bell-sama!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.270
Stay back, please, Haruhime-san!

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:38.210
Right!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.170
<i>I can't let things keep going like this.</i>

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:46.300
<i>If I don't hurry and stop her rampage...</i>

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.520
Wiene!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.900
It seems the civilians are unharmed.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.350
Wait, isn't that Argonaut-kun?

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:14.060
That rabbit punk again?

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.910
<i>Ais-san?</i>

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.950
<i>The Loki Familia?</i>

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:19.990
<i>Why...</i>

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:22.540
Commander, what about that monster?

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.190
There is no stone on its brow. 
Dispose of it immediately.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.410
The Loki Familia?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.120
How did they get here so quickly?

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.590
Could they have guessed this would happen?

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.480
<i>You're a hypocrite!</i>

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.770
<i>A filthy bat.</i>

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:56.450
<i>I... I am...</i>

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.750
<i>I...</i>

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:09.070
<i>I... I am...</i>

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.300
<i>I am... I am...</i>

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:26.590
Huh?

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.910
What is he doing?

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.140
Argonaut-kun?

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:49.770
Bell-kun...

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:52.990
This is brilliant!

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:56.160
Idiot kids like that still exist?

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:57.740
<i>Bell-kun...</i>

00:21:58.570 --> 00:22:00.630
<i>you truly are...</i>

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:02.680
<i>a fool.</i>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Bell Cranel
The Fool</b>

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:37.810
Next time:

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:39.200
"Bell Cranel."
